    summary: "The Journal of Adolescent and Young Adult Oncology is a United States journal catalogued by NLM from 2011, published quarterly from 2011 to 2017 and bimonthly since 2018, and indexed for MEDLINE under the subject headings Adolescent, Young Adult and Neoplasms. NLM and Crossref both list SAGE Publications as the current publisher, and NLM points to the journal's home on the SAGE Journals platform.",
